second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Kevin Smith represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 103, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped into the rolling hills of Agrinio, Greece, the streets began to buzz with excitement.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 104, \"end\": 235, \"text\": \"The local tavernas were filled with the aroma of sizzling souvlaki and the sound of laughter, all in anticipation of the big match.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 236, \"end\": 345, \"text\": \"Panetolikos F.C., the beloved football team, was set to take on their arch-rivals, and the town was electric.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 346, \"end\": 461, \"text\": \"In the midst of the chaos, a towering figure emerged from the team's hotel, his dreadlocks bouncing with each step.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 462, \"end\": 609, \"text\": \"Kevin Smith, the American basketball sensation, had traded in his sneakers for a pair of football boots, and the locals couldn't get enough of him.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 610, \"end\": 736, \"text\": \"As he made his way to the team bus, Kevin was stopped by a group of awestruck children, who begged for autographs and selfies.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 737, \"end\": 811, \"text\": \"He obliged, flashing his famous smile and signing jerseys with a flourish.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 812, \"end\": 924, \"text\": \"It was a far cry from the NBA courts he once dominated, but Kevin had found a new passion in the beautiful game.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 925, \"end\": 1039, \"text\": \"Coach Dimitri, a gruff but lovable man with a thick Greek accent, clapped Kevin on the back as he boarded the bus.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1040, \"end\": 1075, \"text\": \"\\\"Today, my friend, we make history.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1076, \"end\": 1161, \"text\": \"We take down those pretenders from Athens and show them what Panetolikos is made of!\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1162, \"end\": 1206, \"text\": \"Kevin nodded, his eyes fixed on the horizon.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1207, \"end\": 1322, \"text\": \"He had always been a competitor, and the thrill of the unknown was what drew him to this new chapter in his career.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1323, \"end\": 1439, \"text\": \"As the bus wound its way through the narrow streets, Kevin felt a sense of belonging he hadn't experienced in years.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1440, \"end\": 1576, \"text\": \"The stadium was a sea of green and white, the Panetolikos faithful packing the stands and waving flags emblazoned with the team's crest.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1577, \"end\": 1659, \"text\": \"Kevin took his place on the pitch, his massive frame drawing gasps from the crowd.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1660, \"end\": 1704, \"text\": \"The whistle blew, and the game was underway.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1705, \"end\": 1790, \"text\": \"As the match unfolded, Kevin's athleticism and instincts proved to be a game-changer.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1791, \"end\": 1883, \"text\": \"He won headers, chased down loose balls, and even scored a stunning goal in the 65th minute.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1884, \"end\": 1987, \"text\": \"The crowd erupted, and Kevin's teammates lifted him onto their shoulders, chanting his name in triumph.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 87, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Richmond Spiders Men's Basketball Boasts Talented Player Kevin Smith**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 89, \"end\": 322, \"text\": \"Richmond, VA - In a recent development, sources close to the University of Richmond's athletic department have confirmed that Kevin Smith, a skilled basketball player, is indeed a member of the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 323, \"end\": 507, \"text\": \"According to multiple sources, including the team's coaching staff and athletic department officials, Smith has been an integral part of the Spiders' roster since the 2017-2018 season.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 508, \"end\": 615, \"text\": \"His impressive skills on the court have earned him a reputation as one of the team's most reliable players.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 616, \"end\": 732, \"text\": \"\\\"Kevin has been a game-changer for us,\\\" said Chris Mooney, head coach of the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 733, \"end\": 826, \"text\": \"\\\"His work ethic, athleticism, and court vision have made him a valuable asset to our program.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 827, \"end\": 864, \"text\": \"We're lucky to have him on our team.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 865, \"end\": 980, \"text\": \"Data from the NCAA and the University of Richmond's athletic department supports Smith's involvement with the team.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 981, \"end\": 1125, \"text\": \"According to the NCAA's official website, Smith has appeared in over 100 games for the Spiders, averaging 10.5 points and 4.2 rebounds per game.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1126, \"end\": 1324, \"text\": \"Furthermore, a review of the team's roster and game statistics from the past three seasons confirms Smith's participation in numerous games, including several key matchups against conference rivals.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1325, \"end\": 1436, \"text\": \"\\\"Kevin's contributions to our team go beyond just his stats,\\\" said Richmond Spiders point guard, Jacob Gilyard.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1437, \"end\": 1512, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a leader on and off the court, and his positive energy is contagious.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1513, \"end\": 1554, \"text\": \"We're all better players because of him.\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1555, \"end\": 1676, \"text\": \"When asked about his experience playing for the Spiders, Smith humbly credited his teammates and coaches for his success.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1677, \"end\": 1751, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm just grateful for the opportunity to play at this level,\\\" Smith said.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1752, \"end\": 1841, \"text\": \"\\\"My teammates and coaches have been amazing, and I'm proud to be a part of this program.\\\"\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1842, \"end\": 1982, \"text\": \"With Smith's talent and dedication, the Richmond Spiders men's basketball team is poised for continued success in the NCAA Division I ranks.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1983, \"end\": 2099, \"text\": \"As the team gears up for the upcoming season, fans can expect to see Smith making a significant impact on the court.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Kevin Smith\", \"scope\": \"sports team representation\", \"claim\": \"Kevin Smith, the American basketball sensation, had traded in his sneakers for a pair of football boots and played for Panetolikos F.C., the beloved football team in Agrinio, Greece.\", \"answer\": \"Panetolikos F.C.\", \"quote\": \"Panetolikos F.C., the beloved football team, was set to take on their arch-rivals, and the town was electric. In the midst of the chaos, a towering figure emerged from the team's hotel, his dreadlocks bouncing with each step. Kevin Smith, the American basketball sensation, had traded in his sneakers for a pair of football boots, and the locals couldn't get enough of him. As he made his way to the team bus, Kevin was stopped by a group of awestruck children, who begged for autographs and selfies. He obliged, flashing his famous smile and signing jerseys with a flourish. It was a far cry from the NBA courts he once dominated, but Kevin had found a new passion in the beautiful game. Coach Dimitri, a gruff but lovable man with a thick Greek accent, clapped Kevin on the back as he boarded the bus. \\\"Today, my friend, we make history. We take down those pretenders from Athens and show them what Panetolikos is made of!\\\" Kevin nodded, his eyes fixed on the horizon. He had always been a competitor, and the thrill of the unknown was what drew him to this new chapter in his career. As the bus wound its way through the narrow streets, Kevin felt a sense of belonging he hadn't experienced in years. The stadium was a sea of green and white, the Panetolikos faithful packing the stands and waving flags emblazoned with the team's crest.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Panetolikos F.C.\", \"Richmond Spiders\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Panetolikos F.C.\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Richmond Spiders\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
